                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "4 Any job evaluation shall be undertaken pursuant to an industry recognized evaluation method, as determined by the Personnel Administrator (e.g. whole job ranking, point factor analysis, factor comparison, etc.);",
